<title>UK: GAN privatisation could begin before summer-FT.</title>
<headline>GAN privatisation could begin before summer-FT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The privatisation of the principal operating business of GAN, the troubled French state-owned insurance company, could begin before the summer, the Financial Times said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said officials close to the discussions indicated formal preparations for the sale of UIC, GAN's lending arm, as well as GAN Assurances, its insurance arm, and CIC, the regional banking network, could begin in the next three months.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
